{
	"_help": "Act 3, the fork on the desert road (after the desert pick, event desert_fork): the Egyptologist (first of Eleanor, Pembroke, Hassan) wants the temple, the guide (first of Saleh, Youssef, Farid) the town. You decide: fork_temple / fork_town (end_temple / end_town), and everyone in the party who cares reacts. A Hassan who heard you talk treasure in Cairo plays it down (hassan_misdirected). Then open board act3_desert_branch. Generated by tools/dialogue/make_act3.py.",
	"speakers": {
		"player": "You",
		"eleanor": "Eleanor Whitmore",
		"pembroke": "Dr. Arthur Pembroke",
		"hassan": "Dr. Hassan al-Masri",
		"hargreaves": "Tom Hargreaves",
		"idris": "Idris Mahjoub",
		"isabelle": "Isabelle Moreau",
		"saleh": "Saleh al-Rashidi",
		"youssef": "Youssef Nabil",
		"farid": "Farid Mansour",
		"mahmoud": "Mahmoud Fawzi",
		"khalil": "Khalil Darwish",
		"naguib": "Naguib Sabet"
	},
